Definition of numerator:
The number of people identifying themselves as from an ethnic minority background (that is, not from the White British group which includes White English, Welsh, Scottish or Northern Irish groups) as per the 2021 census categories. Ethnic minority groups include the following census ethnicity descriptions:

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom-width: var(--bs-border-width); border-left: none; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline: none; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 9999px var(--bs-table-bg-state,var(--bs-table-bg-type,var(--bs-table-accent-bg)));">Asian or Asian British group;
<div style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom-width: var(--bs-border-width); border-left: none; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline: none; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 9999px var(--bs-table-bg-state,var(--bs-table-bg-type,var(--bs-table-accent-bg)));">Black, Black British, Caribbean or African group;
<div style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom-width: var(--bs-border-width); border-left: none; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline: none; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 9999px var(--bs-table-bg-state,var(--bs-table-bg-type,var(--bs-table-accent-bg)));">Mixed or Multiple ethnic group;
<div style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom-width: var(--bs-border-width); border-left: none; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline: none; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 9999px var(--bs-table-bg-state,var(--bs-table-bg-type,var(--bs-table-accent-bg)));">Other ethnic group;White Gypsy or Irish Traveller groupWhite Irish group;
<div style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom-width: var(--bs-border-width); border-left: none; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline: none; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 9999px var(--bs-table-bg-state,var(--bs-table-bg-type,var(--bs-table-accent-bg)));">White Roma group;White Other group.

Methodology:
Ethnicity counts were taken from the NOMIS website using the query data function. The data table used was Ethnic group by age and sex (RM032).The numerator was calculated by summing the follwing groups:
<div style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom-width: var(--bs-border-width); border-left: none; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline: none; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 9999px var(--bs-table-bg-state,var(--bs-table-bg-type,var(--bs-table-accent-bg)));">Asian or Asian British group;
<div style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom-width: var(--bs-border-width); border-left: none; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline: none; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 9999px var(--bs-table-bg-state,var(--bs-table-bg-type,var(--bs-table-accent-bg)));">Black, Black British, Caribbean or African group;
<div style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom-width: var(--bs-border-width); border-left: none; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline: none; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 9999px var(--bs-table-bg-state,var(--bs-table-bg-type,var(--bs-table-accent-bg)));">Mixed or Multiple ethnic group;
<div style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom-width: var(--bs-border-width); border-left: none; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline: none; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 9999px var(--bs-table-bg-state,var(--bs-table-bg-type,var(--bs-table-accent-bg)));">Other ethnic group;White Gypsy or Irish Traveller groupWhite Irish group;
<div style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom-width: var(--bs-border-width); border-left: none; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline: none; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 9999px var(--bs-table-bg-state,var(--bs-table-bg-type,var(--bs-table-accent-bg)));">White Roma group;White Other group.
The total population answering the ethnic category question was used for the denominator. The proportion was multipled by 100 to express the indicator as a percentage and 95% confidence intervals were added.

